0","id":1287636,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ve moved twice since the Kickstarter, and they are mailing it to my old apartment because I missed window for giving my address because I didn\u2019t know of how to update it until I received the final address mail. I\u2019m used to how they changed it were it\u2019s on Backerkit and I can just update that. Now I\u2019m in Michigan without a car so I have to walk and take out of the way bus stop to reach my 3rd post office because they keep bouncing me around. I hope I can get my package, but I\u2019m VERY displeased. This is my only day off, I work six days a week and it\u2019s snow flurring. Meanwhile when I private messaged the Kickstarter crew they told me it\u2019s not there problem I should have been reading each and every Email on time for an older then 4 year Kickstarter even though I get a ton of these emails...<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve sunk thousands and dollars into Onyx Path/Whitewolf and I sometimes feel a, \u201cI don\u2019t care if your upset we have more customers where that comes from\u201d mentality. I went from enthusiastically backing everything to now reconsidering things.<br /> <br /> I just want to know I\u2019ll get my book, I\u2019m even okay with it being late, but if it gets mailed to some rando and I can never get my copy I\u2019ll be severely disappointed.<br /> <br /> I didn\u2019t complain about the Exalted Delays or the other kickstarters, but I end up shelling out a good amount of money for a deluxe book, having it finished like an Olympics cycle later and never getting it I\u2019m going to be very disappointed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":